  "years": "Start 1937 is solid (Wikipedia, Mac's, EngineLabs). Passenger-car end 1952: the 1953 GM kit and 1953 brochure show 235.5 engines (108/115 hp) in all 1953 cars, and restore-an-old-car says 1937-1952. Wikipedia lists 92 hp '1950-1953' and HotSixes says 'until 1963' (wrong for cars). Truck/sedan-delivery use in 1953 only from forums. Suggested value: 1937-1952 (passenger cars).",
